{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pivot of Hearts",
    "steam_appid": 1716820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716820/extras/3c34d0044c11fb275482b2a3afc2be91.avif?t=1748890940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pivot of Hearts</strong> is a non-monogamous romance visual novel with a simple card game built into it. It takes place in the city of S\u00e3o Paulo and tells the story of W\u00e9n Xi\u00e0n, a Taiwanese-Brazilian game developer who, after a long period of isolation, starts finding chances to open his heart again: he suddenly reconnects with Etsuko, someone important from his past, and forms an unexpected bond with a new colleague, Cau\u00e3. As he navigates through an exciting TTRPG adventure, heavy metal concerts, magical-boy dreams, and the usual young adult suffering, W\u00e9n will have to reexamine his old notions of love and play his cards right to achieve true happiness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716820/extras/6cb18bfde43fb180915340a14f4e1c91.avif?t=1748890940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 100k+ words of sweet nerdy romance and realistic non-monogamy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 5 different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 8 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Tarot-based card game mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Beautiful handcrafted original art and music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Original illustrations by L\u00edvia Santos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Original soundtrack by Livia Maki Yoshikawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Available in Portuguese and English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Steam achievements reward the most curious players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning:</strong>\u00a0This game contains sequences of flashing lights. This effect can be disabled in the options menu.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716820/extras/3c34d0044c11fb275482b2a3afc2be91.avif?t=1748890940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pivot of Hearts</strong> is a non-monogamous romance visual novel with a simple card game built into it. It takes place in the city of S\u00e3o Paulo and tells the story of W\u00e9n Xi\u00e0n, a Taiwanese-Brazilian game developer who, after a long period of isolation, starts finding chances to open his heart again: he suddenly reconnects with Etsuko, someone important from his past, and forms an unexpected bond with a new colleague, Cau\u00e3. As he navigates through an exciting TTRPG adventure, heavy metal concerts, magical-boy dreams, and the usual young adult suffering, W\u00e9n will have to reexamine his old notions of love and play his cards right to achieve true happiness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716820/extras/6cb18bfde43fb180915340a14f4e1c91.avif?t=1748890940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 100k+ words of sweet nerdy romance and realistic non-monogamy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 5 different endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 8 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Tarot-based card game mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Beautiful handcrafted original art and music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Original illustrations by L\u00edvia Santos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Original soundtrack by Livia Maki Yoshikawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Available in Portuguese and English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2665 Steam achievements reward the most curious players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning:</strong>\u00a0This game contains sequences of flashing lights. This effect can be disabled in the options menu.</p>",
    "short_description": "Game developer W\u00e9n Xi\u00e0n has a second chance at love, but it\u2019s not what he expects. Will he be able to stray off the beaten path and find true happiness? Play your cards right and find out in Pivot of Hearts, a non-monogamous visual novel!",
